# Cached upstream pages and RPC responses (~19 MB). Regenerate with `make collect`.
# The staging documents are kept: they are the intermediate dataset, they carry
# no personal contact details, and networks.py reads the co-signature record
# from one of them.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/staging_*.json

